## Claude Code specifics
{%- if claude_provider == 'litellm' %}

- **Auth:** set `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` (your LiteLLM key) in your shell — never commit it.
  The gateway URL lives in `.claude/settings.json`.
{%- else %}

- **Auth:** run `/login` with your Claude subscription. No gateway or provider env needed.
{%- endif %}

- **One-time plugin install** — `.claude/settings.json` ships with `enabledPlugins`
  entries that only activate after the marketplace + plugins are installed.
  Run this once per machine, then restart Claude Code:
  ```bash
  /plugin marketplace add anthropics/claude-plugins
  /plugin install github@claude-plugins-official
  /plugin install commit-commands@claude-plugins-official
  /plugin install security-guidance@claude-plugins-official
  {%- if include_context7 %}
  /plugin install context7@claude-plugins-official
  {%- endif %}
  ```
{%- if include_context7 %}
- **Context7** is enabled (opt-in): fetches current library docs into the model
  context. External service (`mcp.context7.com`) — queries leave the sandbox.
{%- endif %}

- **Plan Mode** (`Shift+Tab`, read-only) = the architect seat; **Default** = the coder.
  Both share the active model.
- Switch the model in-session with `/model opus|sonnet|haiku`; `effortLevel` defaults
  to `high` (`/effort xhigh` for hard problems). One profile — no profile juggling.
- Read-only subagents auto-delegate (`.claude/agents/`): `researcher` (Haiku recon,
  context-isolated), `reviewer` (independent diff review), `security-auditor`. Offload
  verbose recon/tests to them to keep the main context clean. Built-in `Explore`/`Plan`
  cover quick lookups; subagents cannot spawn subagents.
- **Memory:** native Auto-Memory (`~/.claude/projects/<project>/memory/`) is the
  private tier — `autoMemoryEnabled: true`, inspect via `/memory`. Team memory is
  `guidelines/*.md` + this file (via git). Use `/capture` to promote a private
  learning into team memory when it applies to colleagues.
- Context: the statusline (`.claude/scripts/statusline.sh`) auto-uses
  [`ccusage`](https://github.com/ryoppippi/ccusage) if installed
  (`npm i -g ccusage`) for live token/cost tracking, otherwise falls back to
  `model · dir · branch`. Auto-Compact is on; `/compact` manually at ~70 % usage,
  `/clear` on a topic switch.
- Quality-gate hooks: a `PreToolUse` hook tail-filters verbose `pytest`/`just qa`
  output to save context. A `Stop` hook reminds about uncommitted diffs and the
  `/verify` step. Set `CLAUDE_VERIFY_HARD_BLOCK=1` to make `just qa` a hard gate
  before the turn can end (Claude Code overrides after 8 consecutive blocks).
{%- endif %}
